# 🚀 Quick Start

### Backend

```bash
cd backend

python -m venv venv

source venv/bin/activate

pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn main:app --reload
```

### Frontend

```bash
cd dashboard-angular

npm install

npm start
```

| Service   | URL                   |
| --------- | --------------------- |
| Dashboard | `localhost:4200`      |
| API Docs  | `localhost:8000/docs` |

